Adverse possession-property tax payment
HB0123
defense.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Neiman, Allemand, Andrew, Banks,
Bratten, Clouston, Haroldson, Heiner and Wharff and
Senator(s) Biteman, Boner, Hutchings and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to civil procedure; specifying that the time period for a cause
of action for adverse possession does not run during periods when the property
owner has paid all property taxes; specifying the process for the payment of
legal fees in a claim for adverse possession; specifying applicability; and
providing for an effective date.
