HB0123HS001/ADOPTED
Page 1-line 4 After "taxes;" insert "specifying the process for the
payment of legal fees in a claim for adverse
possession;".
Page 2-line 8 After "hereditaments" insert "that are consistent with
the recorded title and".
Page 2-after line 9 Insert:
"(c) If the defendant to a claim for adverse possession provides proof
of proper title for lands, tenements or hereditaments and the plaintiff to the
claim continues with the claim for adverse possession, the plaintiff shall pay
all costs and attorney fees associated with the action if the plaintiff loses
the claim.". WINTER, CHAIRMAN
